message: "If you use these reproducibility materials, cite this GitHub repository."
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/shaikhamalkawi-ux/HbA1c-Age-Aware-Reliability-NHANES"
title: "Subgroup calibration of HbA1c predictions across NHANES cycles: reproducibility materials"
version: "1.0.2"
date-released: "2026-09-16"
license: "MIT"
authors:
  - family-names: "Malkawi"
    given-names: "Ghassan"
abstract: "Public reproducibility materials for HbA1c subgroup-calibration and temporal-transport evaluation across NHANES cycles, including source-reconstruction certificates, aggregate repeated out-of-fold and conformal metrics, public-safe major-revision sensitivity summaries, temporal-transport verification, recovered secondary CQR output checks, and historical ANFIS structural verification. Participant-level NHANES data are not redistributed."
keywords:
  - HbA1c
  - NHANES
  - reproducibility
  - conformal prediction
  - subgroup calibration
  - temporal transport
